          <h3 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Refer a Business</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6;font-size:0.95rem;">Send us a business that needs compliance scanning, website management, or IT support. We'll handle the rest.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:16px;padding:32px;text-align:center;">
          <div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 20px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:#8b5cf6;">2</div>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">We Close & Deliver</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6;font-size:0.95rem;">Our team handles the sales call, onboarding, and 24/7 service. You never have to manage the account.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--border-color);border-radius:16px;padding:32px;text-align:center;">
          <div style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 20px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:#8b5cf6;">3</div>
